              "content": "Search for news articles using a fulltext search. All specified criteria need to be fulfilled for an article to match. Each criterion is handled according to its selectionType; \"include\" requires the criterion to evaluate to true, \"exclude\" requires the criterion to evaluate to false. A criterion is fulfilled when at least one of its values is found.",
